          "description": "One entry per stated income: earner, source, amount, frequency, and whether net. Preserve the period exactly \u2014 \u0027every four weeks\u0027 is not \u0027per month\u0027. A State Pension payable from a future age, or expected future self-employment earnings, is provenance modality Projected; an income stated as in payment now is Actual or Reported. This is the one fact the SR-internal consistency check reconciles, so a projection recorded as a current figure produces a contradiction that does not exist. An income that has ceased or will cease is still an entry, with the cessation recorded."
