            "documentCategory": "I_RecommendationsAndAdvice"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Greater Investment Choice - The new scheme offers access to a wider range of investment options, allowing for a more tailored investment strategy that better suits your risk profile and retirement goals, and allowing greater choice should your risk profile change in the future.",
          "topic": "GreaterInvestmentChoice",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "linkedObjectiveIds": [
            "OBJ3"
          ],
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "pageNumbers": [
              6
            ],
            "documentCategory": "I_RecommendationsAndAdvice"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Adviser Charging Facilitation - The new scheme allows adviser charges to be deducted directly, ensuring ongoing financial planning support without the need for separate payments. This makes it easier to manage your retirement strategy effectively.",
          "topic": "AdviserChargingFacilitation",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "pageNumbers": [
              6
            ],
            "documentCategory": "I_RecommendationsAndAdvice"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoing Monitoring and Adjustments - By moving to the recommended scheme, I will have the ability to actively monitor and adjust your investments as required, helping to ensure they remain aligned with your changing needs and market conditions.",
          "topic": "OngoingMonitoring",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "pageNumbers": [
              6
            ],
            "documentCategory": "I_RecommendationsAndAdvice"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Multi-asset fund selection - The new scheme offers risk level 5 funds, whereas Zurich does not offer risk level 5 funds and would require a blend of a risk level 7 and a risk level 2 fund which reduces diversification.",
          "topic": "MultiAssetFunds",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "linkedObjectiveIds": [
